WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:03.791
Careful: const fixes the variable, not its contents.

2
00:03.791 --> 00:06.299
You can still add to a constant array with push.

3
00:06.299 --> 00:11.071
But giving the constant itself a new value doesn't work. That gives a TypeError.

4
00:11.071 --> 00:14.320
Use const when you are sure the variable won't change.
